3:["$","p","9",{"className":"text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-text-secondary","children":"When you run AIIC on your own hardware, you are the data controller. We have no access to your instance, its users, or its content. The software is provided under the AIIC License (see the License page); these terms apply to your use of our update servers, downloads, and trademarks."}]
